23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4ee00dba39c8f7072d05bb3964d28ee 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": true, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/94a536ad/uploads/origins/01753c36-4110-467b-84b6-d1c294c8b3da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bda699e806ef53c6a27d9367ee1ab7a9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/94a536ad/uploads/origins/01753c36-4110-467b-84b6-d1c294c8b3da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bda699e806ef53c6a27d9367ee1ab7a9, https://si.imgix.net/94a536ad/uploads/origins/01753c36-4110-467b-84b6-d1c294c8b3da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=48d0cbf478e2936ae0429775d07924be 2x, https://si.imgix.net/94a536ad/uploads/origins/01753c36-4110-467b-84b6-d1c294c8b3da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e6eff11a8298021383f8cd4e9b8ddf43 3x"}, "body": "Please create a 17-page full-color comic.\nThe female protagonist of the comic is Hindenburg (Azur Lane), based on the original character art.\nhttps://azurlane.wikiru.jp/?%E3%83%92%E3%83%B3%E3%83%87%E3%83%B3%E3%83%96%E3%83%AB%E3%82%AF\nThe male protagonists are two orcs\n1. Hindenburg looks down haughtily at an orc she considers filthy, flapping her wings as she hovers in midair, disdainfully displaying her superiority as a succubus—her \"wings\" and her swaying \"tail.\" Meanwhile, the other orc is hiding behind Hindenburg, observing and waiting for the right moment to strike.\n2. The battle begins. The focus of this fight is on Hindenburg using her agile wings to dodge attacks. Eventually, Hindenburg knocks the beastman to the ground, discovers his massive penis, and gleefully prepares to drain him dry. Meanwhile, the other beastman seems to have spotted Hindenburg’s weakness: her “wings.”\n3. Hindenburg wraps her tail around the beastman’s penis, ready to enjoy it. But unexpectedly, the other orc took advantage of her momentary lapse in defense, charging out immediately and grabbing Hindenburg’s wings. Hindenburg, suspended in the air, was caught off guard as her wings were seized. At this point, I want to dedicate more detail to the scene where her wings are torn off—focusing on Hindenburg being caught off guard, followed by her wings being completely ripped away. The orc who tore off the wings tossed them to his companion, and together they toyed with them. I’d like to see more of this scene.\n4. Next, I want the rape scene: the orc grabs Hindenburg’s tail, which brings her to climax, and positions it against her anus. Before Hindenburg can even begin to beg for mercy, the orc thrusts the tail inside her.\nThe two orcs, one on each side, grabbed the horns on Hindenburg’s head and sucked on her magic-infused milk.\nThe main climax of this commission lies in the wing scene; I hope to faithfully recreate the wings from the original work.", "nc": 170, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@jason15623798/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "comic", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1393087, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/11953ece/uploads/origins/bca72148-430d-4aa0-808c-a1b97a402034?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b9b0951f797ce0b27eef2b5c286e9127", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/11953ece/uploads/origins/bca72148-430d-4aa0-808c-a1b97a402034?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b9b0951f797ce0b27eef2b5c286e9127, https://si.imgix.net/11953ece/uploads/origins/bca72148-430d-4aa0-808c-a1b97a402034?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fd68aadf33456c8117676693aab874b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/11953ece/uploads/origins/bca72148-430d-4aa0-808c-a1b97a402034?bg=%23fff&auto=